OL,3,ATrump ordered to answer questions under
OL,4,Aoath in BBC lawsuit
OL,5,
OL,6,FTrump cancelled a previous deposition
OL,7,Fon 16 October, citing "matters of
OL,8,Fnational importance" while he was
OL,9,Fcampaigning in Georgia.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/19
